#: ../../api/types/input_rich_block_section_heading.rst:3
msgid "InputRichBlockSectionHeading"
msgstr "InputRichBlockSectionHeading"

#: litegram.types.input_rich_block_section_heading.InputRichBlockSectionHeading:1
#: of
msgid ""
"A section heading, corresponding to the HTML tags :code:`<h1>`, "
":code:`<h2>`, :code:`<h3>`, :code:`<h4>`, :code:`<h5>`, or :code:`<h6>`."
msgstr ""
"Заголовок раздела; соответствует HTML-тегам :code:`<h1>`, :code:`<h2>`, "
":code:`<h3>`, :code:`<h4>`, :code:`<h5>` или :code:`<h6>`."

#: litegram.types.input_rich_block_section_heading.InputRichBlockSectionHeading:3
#: of
msgid "Source: https://core.telegram.org/bots/api#inputrichblocksectionheading"
msgstr "Источник: https://core.telegram.org/bots/api#inputrichblocksectionheading"

#: litegram.types.input_rich_block_section_heading.InputRichBlockSectionHeading.type:1
#: of
msgid "Type of the block, always 'heading'"
msgstr "Тип блока, всегда 'heading'"

#: litegram.types.input_rich_block_section_heading.InputRichBlockSectionHeading.text:1
#: of
msgid "Text of the block"
msgstr "Текст блока"

#: litegram.types.input_rich_block_section_heading.InputRichBlockSectionHeading.size:1
#: of
msgid "Relative size of the text font; 1-6, 1 is the largest, 6 is the smallest"
msgstr ""
"Относительный размер шрифта текста; от 1 до 6, где 1 — самый крупный, 6 —"
" самый мелкий"

